== Effects ==
* Grants one [[Health#Red Heart Containers|Heart container]].
* Fully restores Isaac's red [[health]]. Does not affect {{e|Soul Heart}}s and {{e|Black Heart}}s.

== Notes ==
* This item can drop from killing {{E|Gluttony}}. {{dlc|nr}} Gluttony can drop this item even if Isaac has already encountered/possessed it. 
** {{dlc+|r}} It can also be spawned by {{e|Bumbino}} if he picks up 12 cents.{{dlc-}}

